An amazingly well done Action RPG game with an amazing story all created in RPG Maker utilizing lots of custom assets including backgrounds and tiles, character and enemy models, cutscene and text images, animations and many scripts. Heck, the combat script was built by the developer and works exceptionally well with this game.
This game is a clear example of a developer who loves their creation like their own child (
).
Three endings overall in which any could be considered canon (
)
As for me, this game is the best RPG Maker game I've ever played and it was well worth the almost 6 nonstop hours I put into it. I highly recommend it to all RPG genre fans.
